{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 3500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "# 随机变量、分布与矩\n\n从上到下读：先把 outcome 变成数值，再用 CDF 统一表示分布；随后分清点质量、密度与更一般的分布成分，再进入期望、二阶矩、Bernoulli 计数、向量协方差和使用边界。\n\n每个节点都是一个可独立链接和复习的知识点。颜色表示本图中的语义角色，不表示掌握度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4e5f60718293a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[随机变量]]\n*Random variable*\n\n把 outcome 映射成数值的可测函数；事件由数值集合的原像得到。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5f60718293a4b5c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[累积分布函数]]\n*Cumulative distribution function*\n\n$F_X(x)=P(X\\le x)$ 统一表示离散、绝对连续、混合与奇异分布。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f60718293a4b5c6d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[概率质量函数]]\n*Probability mass function*\n\n离散分布在每个可能取值上分配点概率。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0718293a4b5c6d7e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[概率密度函数]]\n*Probability density function*\n\n绝对连续分布通过区间上的积分给概率。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "18293a4b5c6d7e8f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[PMF不等于密度]]\n*PMF is not density*\n\nPMF 值是点概率；密度高度只有积分后才产生概率。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "293a4b5c6d7e8f90",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[连续CDF不保证密度]]\n*Continuous CDF need not have density*\n\n连续排除跳跃；存在密度还要求更强的绝对连续性。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a4b5c6d7e8f9012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[随机变量的分布变换|随机变量变换]]\n*Transformed distribution*\n\n从事件原像出发，并汇总所有分支和局部尺度校正。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b5c6d7e8f901234",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[Bernoulli分布]]\n*Bernoulli distribution*\n\n一次成功概率为 $p$ 的 0/1 试验。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "5c6d7e8f90123456",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[二项分布]]\n*Binomial distribution*\n\n在 $0,\\ldots,n$ 上具有二项式 PMF 的离散分布。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d7e8f9012345678",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[Bernoulli和的二项分布]]\n*When a Bernoulli sum is Binomial*\n\n共同 $p$ 与相互独立是标准充分条件；缺少条件时不能只凭边际推出二项分布。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e8f90123456789a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[期望]]\n*Expectation*\n\n可积随机变量相对于其分布的加权平均。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f90123456789abc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[期望线性性]]\n*Linearity of expectation*\n\n有限个可积变量的期望线性性不要求独立。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "90123456789abcde",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[方差]]\n*Variance*\n\n相对均值的平方偏离的期望。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0123456789abcdef",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[方差的仿射变换]]\n*Affine scaling of variance*\n\n平移不改变方差，尺度 $a$ 使方差乘以 $a^2$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "123456789abcdef0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[协方差]]\n*Covariance*\n\n两个变量中心化乘积的期望，数值受单位影响。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0b1c2d3e4f50617",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[协方差矩阵半正定性]]\n*Covariance matrices are positive semidefinite*\n\n实随机向量任意线性投影的方差都非负，因此协方差矩阵对称半正定。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5061728",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[协方差奇异性]]\n*Covariance singularity*\n\n某个非零线性组合几乎处处为常数，当且仅当协方差矩阵奇异。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "23456789abcdef01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[相关系数]]\n*Pearson correlation*\n\n用两个标准差标准化协方差，得到无量纲线性度量。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "3456789abcdef012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[零协方差不推独立]]\n*Zero covariance is not independence*\n\n零协方差仍可能隐藏确定而强烈的非线性关系。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "456789abcdef0123",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[矩存在性的使用边界]]\n*Moment-existence boundary*\n\n归一化不保证矩有限；先查绝对矩收敛，再调用相关定理。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2mom",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[原点矩与中心矩]]\n\n幂作用在原值还是中心化值上。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPowers of values or of centred values.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2lot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[LOTUS]]\n\n直接按原分布平均变换后的值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAverage transformed values under the original law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2uni",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[连续均匀分布]]\n\n区间内等长区间得到等概率。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEqual lengths receive equal probabilities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2unim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[均匀分布的矩]]\n\n中点决定均值，长度平方决定方差。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMidpoint sets the mean; squared length sets variance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2norm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[正态分布]]\n\n位置与正尺度决定高斯密度。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nLocation and positive scale specify a Gaussian density.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2std",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[正态标准化]]\n\n完整密度换元给出标准正态。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA full density transformation gives the standard normal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2local",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[密度的局部概率解释]]\n\n连续点附近，密度乘长度近似区间概率。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAt continuity points, height times width approximates probability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2mix",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[混合分布]]\n\n点质量与连续成分都须计入概率。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAccount for both atoms and continuous mass.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[总体分位数]]\n\nCDF 达到指定概率的最左阈值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe leftmost threshold where a CDF reaches a probability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2pit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[概率积分变换]]\n\n自己的连续 CDF 把变量变成均匀分布。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA continuous CDF maps its own variable to a uniform law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2dec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[递减变换的CDF]]\n\n有点质量时，补概率必须使用左极限。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAtoms require the complementary left limit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2jac",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[密度换元的尺度因子]]\n\n逆导数绝对值保持区间概率。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe absolute inverse derivative preserves interval probability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2nonlin",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3150,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[期望与非线性变换不可交换]]\n\n平均之后再变换通常会改变结果。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTransforming after averaging generally changes the result.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n"
    }
  ],
